---
const workOnCards = [
	{
		title: "Understand (and communicate) what you're feeling",
		body: "Don't know how you feel? Not sure how to talk with partners or friends? Feel so many emotions that talking seems impossible? Identifying and communicating emotions is a skill, and it can be cultivated.",
	},
	{
		title: 'Feel connected to people and place',
		body: 'You might feel alone and isolated, even when surrounded by friends and family. You may struggle to connect with a partner, build new relationships, or feel like you belong at work. Connection is a state of safety and trust, and it can be nurtured.',
	},
	{
		title: 'Have better relationships, and better sex',
		body: 'Many couples get stuck, repeating the same dynamics over and over. Change might feel impossible. Sex might have disappeared, trust might be broken, or touch might be the thing you need most. You might be wondering how you got here. Often we need outside support and a different approach.',
	},
	{
		title: "Work out where you're going",
		body: "Where am I going? What really matters? What will help me live a happy, fulfilling life? These questions can keep you up at night or turn your whole life upside down. They're important, and they deserve time. We can explore them together.",
	},
];
---

<section class="why-youre-here">
	<div class="wrap">
		<h2>You might be here to</h2>
		<div class="why-work-on">
			<div class="why-work-on-grid">
				{
					workOnCards.map((card) => (
						<div class="why-work-on-card">
							<p class="why-work-on-card-title">{card.title}</p>
							<p class="why-work-on-card-body">{card.body}</p>
						</div>
					))
				}
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="specialties-bar">
			<span class="specialties-label">I also work with</span>
			<span class="specialties-items">Anxiety · Depression · Drug &amp; alcohol recovery · ADHD · Autism</span>
		</div>

		<p class="why-youre-here-closing">
			And if you think differently? Everything above still applies. We'll just do it in a way that
			fits how your brain works.
		</p>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.why-youre-here {
		padding: var(--space-20) 0;
		background: var(--color-bg-card);
		border-top: var(--border-hairline) solid var(--color-border);
	}

	.why-youre-here h2 {
		font-size: var(--fs-display);
		line-height: var(--lh-article-title);
		font-weight: var(--fw-medium);
		margin-bottom: var(--space-10);
	}

	.why-work-on {
		margin-top: var(--space-2);
	}

	.why-work-on-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
		gap: var(--space-5);
	}

	.why-work-on-card {
		padding: var(--space-6);
		background: var(--color-bg-page);
		border: var(--border-hairline) solid var(--color-border);
		border-radius: var(--radius-card);
	}

	.why-work-on-card-title {
		font-size: var(--fs-prose-body);
		font-weight: var(--fw-medium);
		color: var(--color-text-primary);
		margin: 0 0 var(--space-2);
	}

	.why-work-on-card-body {
		font-size: var(--fs-prose-body);
		color: var(--color-text-secondary);
		margin: 0;
	}

	@media (max-width: 600px) {
		.why-work-on-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}
	}

	.specialties-bar {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		align-items: baseline;
		gap: var(--space-4);
		margin: var(--space-14) 0 0;
		padding: var(--space-5) 0;
		border-top: var(--border-hairline) solid var(--color-border);
		border-bottom: var(--border-hairline) solid var(--color-border);
	}

	.specialties-label {
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		font-size: var(--fs-caption);
		letter-spacing: var(--ls-wide-label);
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: var(--color-accent);
		font-weight: var(--fw-medium);
	}

	.specialties-items {
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		font-size: var(--fs-tagline);
		letter-spacing: var(--ls-tight-label);
		color: var(--color-text-primary);
		font-weight: var(--fw-regular);
	}

	@media (max-width: 600px) {
		.specialties-items {
			font-size: var(--fs-prose-body);
		}
	}

	.why-youre-here-closing {
		font-size: var(--fs-prose-body);
		font-style: italic;
		color: var(--color-text-secondary);
		max-width: 640px;
		margin: var(--space-10) 0 0;
	}
</style>
